          "text": "Témoignages: BOURTH (27) 10.10.1997 T1 BOURTH (27) 10.10.1997 T2",
          "text_sha256": "ef3c0715402803e766e2a1d86686b477e60c90d165141881710d2d59d7fa5992"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
